      "created_at": "2013-03-03T07:54:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We've been running the statistics now for a little over 3 months.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Im dreadfully curious... What are your thoughts? Are villains and heros starting to fall out like you visioned them to be? in relative power levels? Did you ever think of such things?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We're probably still with like a 7% or so error margin (i donno, im not a math guy like those others) but what do you think? Got any surprises out there that you didnt see coming?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Im sure curious and I'm betting so are others!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(and i bet you guys are SUPER Busy with Shattered timelines, so take your time responding :P)</p>",
